  "Combat.Lethice.RapetacleTurn.TakingAdvantageOf": "Taking advantage of your helpless state, the tentacles wind [if (isnaked) {tighter around you|deeper under your [armor]}], caressing your [nipples] and coating your [butt] in slippery goo. One even seeks out your crotch, none-too-gently prodding around for weak points."
