  "Combat.Lethice.RapetacleTurn.TheTentaclesGrab": "The tentacles grab at you again!"
  "Combat.Lethice.RapetacleTurn.TheTentaclesHolding": "[pg]The tentacles holding you abruptly let go, dropping you to the ground. Climbing up, you look around in alarm, but the tendrils have faded into puffs of black smoke. A breeze from nowhere blows them away, their magic expended."
  "Combat.Lethice.RapetacleTurn.TheTentaclesIn": "[pg]The tentacles in front of you suddenly pop like balloons of black smoke, leaving a greasy mist in their wake. A breeze from nowhere dissipates the remnants of the rapacious tendrils, their magic expended."
