  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.ReachingAroundTo": " reaching around to give your unused [cocks] a tug}. Another demoness snuggles up behind you, pressing a hefty pair of jugs into your back and murmuring about how she wants to see you get bred by that hermaphroditic stud under you."
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.SuddenlyYourEntire": "[pg]Suddenly, your entire body tenses, shivering with new sensation. You look over your shoulder in time to see another succubus crawling up behind you,"
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.TheDemonPurrs": "[pg][say: I can see why they call you 'Champion,'] the demon purrs as her spunk-slathered red prick flops against her belly. [say: Maybe after our queen beats you down, I'll come visit you in the breaking tanks... I could always use another eager little broodmare.]"
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.TheDemonessIsn": "[pg]The demoness isn't far behind. She grabs your hips hard enough that her nails score your flesh, and you feel a rush of sticky, wet heat flooding your"
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.WithMoreAnd": "[pg]With more and more demons crawling up over you, urging you to cement your victory on their companion or adding to your pleasure with mouths and corrupted tongues, it's not long before you surrender to your body's carnal demands. You grind your hips hard and fast against the demoness's mis-matched crotch, loving the way her churning black balls ride in your ass, the way her fist-thick knot hammers against your [vagOrAss]. With so many sensations assaulting your body, it's impossible to hold back. Screaming your ecstasy for the whole hall to hear, you climax, body shuddering and clenching hard around the thick demonic cock spreading you open."
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.Womb": " womb"
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.YouGiveThe": "[pg]You give the buxom demon hermaphrodite down on her ass, letting her rest her head in the lap of another cow-girl demon who's busy sucking off a two-cock'd incubus, and crawl up her shapely red body. [say: Oooh,] the omnibus coos as her throbbing red rocket is pressed between your bodies. [say: Gonna go for a ride, Champion?]"
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.YouOnlyBarely": ". You only barely keep your wits about you enough to push her back down before she can force her knot inside you, though you're treated to a veritable waterfall of white spunk pouring out of your well-bred hole instead."
  "Combat.Lethice.RideCock.YouShoveThe": "[pg]You shove the demoness away, suddenly reminded of her true nature. At least for now, you're sated. Confident in your readiness, you advance on Lethice."
  "Combat.Lethice.Sonicwhip.LethiceRaisesHer": "Lethice raises her sizzling, flame-spitting whip high up overhead, then snaps her arm out and back in an instant, cracking the whip so hard that it gives birth to a shockwave of flame and cacophonous thunder. There's no avoiding the all-encompassing wave of energy. There's not even time to brace yourself. It slams into you, rattling bones and scorching flesh."
  "Combat.Lethice.Struggle.YouPullWith": "You pull with all your might against the grasping tentacles to no avail; their grip is simply too strong!"
  "Combat.Lethice.Triplestroke.LethiceSArm": "Lethice's arm blurs in figure eights, snapping the whip at you from every sides. You'll have a tough time avoiding so many strikes!"
  "Combat.Lethice.Triplestroke.YouDuckAnd": "You duck and weave, barely managing to avoid a stinging slash from the whip!\n"
