  "Combat.Lethice.WhipTrip.YouTryTo": "You try to avoid it, but the burning weapon catches your [leg], simultaneously scorching your flesh and attempting to pull you off balance. "
  "Combat.Lethice.Whipchoke.LethiceStrikesOut": "[say: Silence your prattling, curr.] Lethice strikes out with her whip, aimed at your neck!"
